{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-19662","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20333","text":"os-prism — NPM Package Specification"}]},{"id":"blk-19663","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20334","marks":["bold"],"text":"Package"},{"id":"spn-20335","text":": "},{"id":"spn-20336","marks":["code"],"text":"os-prism"},{"id":"spn-20337","text":" "},{"id":"spn-20338","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version"},{"id":"spn-20339","text":": "},{"id":"spn-20340","marks":["code"],"text":"0.1.0"},{"id":"spn-20341","text":" (initial) "},{"id":"spn-20342","marks":["bold"],"text":"Language"},{"id":"spn-20343","text":": TypeScript (MCP wrapper) + Elixir (engine, vendored escript) "},{"id":"spn-20344","marks":["bold"],"text":"License"},{"id":"spn-20345","text":": Apache-2.0 "},{"id":"spn-20346","marks":["bold"],"text":"Registry"},{"id":"spn-20347","text":": https://www.npmjs.com/package/os-prism "},{"id":"spn-20348","marks":["bold"],"text":"Repository"},{"id":"spn-20349","text":": "},{"id":"spn-20350","marks":["code"],"text":"AmpersandBoxDesign/PRISM"},{"id":"spn-20351","text":" (monorepo subdir)"}]},{"id":"blk-19664","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20352","text":"Purpose"}]},{"id":"blk-19665","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20353","marks":["code"],"text":"os-prism"},{"id":"spn-20354","text":" is the MCP server for OS-009 PRISM. It exposes the 6 PRISM loop-phase machines ("},{"id":"spn-20355","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-20356","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20357","marks":["code"],"text":"interact"},{"id":"spn-20358","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20359","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-20360","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20361","marks":["code"],"text":"reflect"},{"id":"spn-20362","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20363","marks":["code"],"text":"diagnose"},{"id":"spn-20364","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20365","marks":["code"],"text":"config"},{"id":"spn-20366","text":") over stdio and runs benchmarks against any PULSE-conforming memory system. Unlike the Fly.io-hosted PRISM service, "},{"id":"spn-20367","marks":["code"],"text":"os-prism"},{"id":"spn-20368","text":" runs locally and stores benchmark state in an embedded SQLite + sqlite-vec database."}]},{"id":"blk-19666","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20369","marks":["code"],"text":"os-prism"},{"id":"spn-20370","text":" wraps the existing Elixir PRISM engine via the same postinstall escript pattern that "},{"id":"spn-20371","marks":["code"],"text":"graphonomous"},{"id":"spn-20372","text":" uses. The Elixir engine carries PRISM's sophisticated IRT/Rasch calibration, three-layer judging pipeline, and scenario evolution logic — porting those to JavaScript is out of scope for v0.1 (the JS IRT ecosystem is thin; see "},{"id":"spn-20373","marks":["code"],"text":"../../../memory/research"},{"id":"spn-20374","text":" for details)."}]},{"id":"blk-19667","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20375","text":"Install"}]},{"id":"blk-19668","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"npx -y os-prism --db ~/.os-prism/benchmarks.db"},{"id":"blk-19669","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20376","text":"Or in "},{"id":"spn-20377","marks":["code"],"text":".mcp.json"},{"id":"spn-20378","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-19670","kind":"code","language":"jsonc","text":"{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"prism\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"os-prism\", \"--db\", \"~/.os-prism/benchmarks.db\"]\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-19671","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20379","marks":["code"],"text":"postinstall"},{"id":"spn-20380","text":" fetches the platform-appropriate Elixir escript bundle (darwin-x64, darwin-arm64, linux-x64, linux-arm64) from the GitHub release assets attached to the matching "},{"id":"spn-20381","marks":["code"],"text":"os-prism-vX.Y.Z"},{"id":"spn-20382","text":" git tag, verifies the SHA256, and installs it under "},{"id":"spn-20383","marks":["code"],"text":"vendor/"},{"id":"spn-20384","text":". Offline installs can set "},{"id":"spn-20385","marks":["code"],"text":"PRISM_ESCRIPT_PATH"},{"id":"spn-20386","text":" to skip the fetch."}]},{"id":"blk-19672","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20387","text":"CLI Flags"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-19674","spans":[{"id":"spn-20388","text":"Flag"}]},{"id":"blk-19675","spans":[{"id":"spn-20389","text":"Default"}]},{"id":"blk-19676","spans":[{"id":"spn-20390","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-19673","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-19677","spans":[{"id":"spn-20391","marks":["code"],"text":"--db <path>"}]},{"id":"blk-19678","spans":[{"id":"spn-20392","marks":["code"],"text":"~/.os-prism/benchmarks.db"}]},{"id":"blk-19679","spans":[{"id":"spn-20393","text":"SQLite database path."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19680","spans":[{"id":"spn-20394","marks":["code"],"text":"--transport"}]},{"id":"blk-19681","spans":[{"id":"spn-20395","marks":["code"],"text":"stdio"}]},{"id":"blk-19682","spans":[{"id":"spn-20396","marks":["code"],"text":"stdio"},{"id":"spn-20397","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-20398","marks":["code"],"text":"http"},{"id":"spn-20399","text":"."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19683","spans":[{"id":"spn-20400","marks":["code"],"text":"--port <n>"}]},{"id":"blk-19684","spans":[{"id":"spn-20401","marks":["code"],"text":"4712"}]},{"id":"blk-19685","spans":[{"id":"spn-20402","text":"HTTP port (ignored for stdio)."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19686","spans":[{"id":"spn-20403","marks":["code"],"text":"--engine-path <path>"}]},{"id":"blk-19687","spans":[{"id":"spn-20404","marks":["code"],"text":"./vendor/prism_engine"}]},{"id":"blk-19688","spans":[{"id":"spn-20405","text":"Path to the bundled Elixir escript."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19689","spans":[{"id":"spn-20406","marks":["code"],"text":"--llm-provider"}]},{"id":"blk-19690","spans":[{"id":"spn-20407","marks":["code"],"text":"openrouter"}]},{"id":"blk-19691","spans":[{"id":"spn-20408","marks":["code"],"text":"openrouter"},{"id":"spn-20409","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20410","marks":["code"],"text":"anthropic"},{"id":"spn-20411","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20412","marks":["code"],"text":"openai"},{"id":"spn-20413","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20414","marks":["code"],"text":"gemini"},{"id":"spn-20415","text":"."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19692","spans":[{"id":"spn-20416","marks":["code"],"text":"--llm-api-key-env"}]},{"id":"blk-19693","spans":[{"id":"spn-20417","marks":["code"],"text":"OPENROUTER_API_KEY"}]},{"id":"blk-19694","spans":[{"id":"spn-20418","text":"Env var name to read the API key from."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19695","spans":[{"id":"spn-20419","marks":["code"],"text":"--log-level"}]},{"id":"blk-19696","spans":[{"id":"spn-20420","marks":["code"],"text":"info"}]},{"id":"blk-19697","spans":[{"id":"spn-20421","marks":["code"],"text":"debug"},{"id":"spn-20422","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20423","marks":["code"],"text":"info"},{"id":"spn-20424","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20425","marks":["code"],"text":"warn"},{"id":"spn-20426","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20427","marks":["code"],"text":"error"},{"id":"spn-20428","text":"."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19698","spans":[{"id":"spn-20429","marks":["code"],"text":"--version"},{"id":"spn-20430","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-20431","marks":["code"],"text":"--help"}]},{"id":"blk-19699","spans":[{"id":"spn-20432","text":"—"}]},{"id":"blk-19700","spans":[{"id":"spn-20433","text":"Print and exit."}]}]]},{"id":"blk-19701","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20434","text":"Dependencies"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-19703","spans":[{"id":"spn-20435","text":"Dependency"}]},{"id":"blk-19704","spans":[{"id":"spn-20436","text":"Version"}]},{"id":"blk-19705","spans":[{"id":"spn-20437","text":"Why"}]}],"id":"blk-19702","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-19706","spans":[{"id":"spn-20438","marks":["code"],"text":"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk"}]},{"id":"blk-19707","spans":[{"id":"spn-20439","marks":["code"],"text":"^1.29.0"}]},{"id":"blk-19708","spans":[{"id":"spn-20440","text":"Stable v1.x MCP surface."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19709","spans":[{"id":"spn-20441","marks":["code"],"text":"better-sqlite3"}]},{"id":"blk-19710","spans":[{"id":"spn-20442","marks":["code"],"text":"^12.8.0"}]},{"id":"blk-19711","spans":[{"id":"spn-20443","text":"SQLite bindings (benchmark metadata)."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19712","spans":[{"id":"spn-20444","marks":["code"],"text":"sqlite-vec"}]},{"id":"blk-19713","spans":[{"id":"spn-20445","marks":["code"],"text":"^0.1.10"}]},{"id":"blk-19714","spans":[{"id":"spn-20446","text":"Vector index over scenario embeddings."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19715","spans":[{"id":"spn-20447","marks":["code"],"text":"zod"}]},{"id":"blk-19716","spans":[{"id":"spn-20448","marks":["code"],"text":"^3.23.0"}]},{"id":"blk-19717","spans":[{"id":"spn-20449","text":"Tool input schemas."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19718","spans":[{"id":"spn-20450","marks":["code"],"text":"yargs"}]},{"id":"blk-19719","spans":[{"id":"spn-20451","marks":["code"],"text":"^17.7.0"}]},{"id":"blk-19720","spans":[{"id":"spn-20452","text":"CLI parsing."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19721","spans":[{"id":"spn-20453","marks":["code"],"text":"node-fetch"}]},{"id":"blk-19722","spans":[{"id":"spn-20454","marks":["code"],"text":"^3.3.2"}]},{"id":"blk-19723","spans":[{"id":"spn-20455","text":"Escript bundle download (postinstall)."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19724","spans":[{"id":"spn-20456","text":"(Elixir runtime)"}]},{"id":"blk-19725","spans":[{"id":"spn-20457","text":"via escript"}]},{"id":"blk-19726","spans":[{"id":"spn-20458","marks":["code"],"text":"vendor/prism_engine"},{"id":"spn-20459","text":" — the PRISM OTP app as an escript."}]}]]},{"id":"blk-19727","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20460","text":"The Elixir engine itself pulls: "},{"id":"spn-20461","marks":["code"],"text":"ecto_sqlite3"},{"id":"spn-20462","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20463","marks":["code"],"text":"exqlite"},{"id":"spn-20464","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20465","marks":["code"],"text":"req"},{"id":"spn-20466","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20467","marks":["code"],"text":"jason"},{"id":"spn-20468","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20469","marks":["code"],"text":"peri"},{"id":"spn-20470","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20471","marks":["code"],"text":"nimble_options"},{"id":"spn-20472","text":". These live inside the escript bundle — they do "},{"id":"spn-20473","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-20474","text":" appear in "},{"id":"spn-20475","marks":["code"],"text":"package.json"},{"id":"spn-20476","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-19728","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20477","text":"Wire Protocol (Node ⇄ Elixir)"}]},{"id":"blk-19729","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20478","text":"The TS MCP server spawns the vendored escript as a child process and communicates over line-delimited JSON on the escript's stdin/stdout. Each MCP tool call is translated into a single JSON-RPC-style request:"}]},{"id":"blk-19730","kind":"code","language":"jsonc","text":"// TS → escript\n{ \"id\": \"req-123\", \"method\": \"interact.run\", \"params\": { \"scenario_id\": \"s42\" } }\n\n// escript → TS\n{ \"id\": \"req-123\", \"ok\": true, \"result\": { \"run_id\": \"r_...\", \"transcript\": \"…\" } }"},{"id":"blk-19731","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20479","text":"The escript exposes exactly the same 6 machines + actions that the Elixir PRISM application currently supports, so the TS wrapper is a thin pass-through with zod input validation and MCP response shaping."}]},{"id":"blk-19732","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20480","text":"SQLite Schema (TS-side)"}]},{"id":"blk-19733","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20481","text":"The TS wrapper stores a small projection for fast MCP resource responses; the authoritative benchmark state lives inside the escript's own SQLite file (at the path passed via "},{"id":"spn-20482","marks":["code"],"text":"--db"},{"id":"spn-20483","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-19734","kind":"code","language":"sql","text":"CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS systems (\n  id             TEXT PRIMARY KEY,                -- e.g. \"graphonomous@0.4.0\"\n  name           TEXT NOT NULL,\n  manifest_uri   TEXT,                            -- PULSE manifest URL or file path\n  registered_at  INTEGER NOT NULL\n);\n\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS runs (\n  id             TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n  system_id      TEXT NOT NULL,\n  scenario_id    TEXT NOT NULL,\n  status         TEXT NOT NULL,                   -- queued | running | ok | error\n  started_at     INTEGER NOT NULL,\n  ended_at       INTEGER,\n  transcript_uri TEXT,                            -- engine-side URI\n  FOREIGN KEY (system_id) REFERENCES systems (id)\n);"},{"id":"blk-19735","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20484","text":"MCP Tools (6 machines, 47 actions — delegated to Elixir)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-19737","spans":[{"id":"spn-20485","text":"Machine"}]},{"id":"blk-19738","spans":[{"id":"spn-20486","text":"Actions"}]}],"id":"blk-19736","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-19739","spans":[{"id":"spn-20487","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"}]},{"id":"blk-19740","spans":[{"id":"spn-20488","marks":["code"],"text":"scenarios"},{"id":"spn-20489","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20490","marks":["code"],"text":"validate"},{"id":"spn-20491","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20492","marks":["code"],"text":"list"},{"id":"spn-20493","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20494","marks":["code"],"text":"get"},{"id":"spn-20495","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20496","marks":["code"],"text":"retire"},{"id":"spn-20497","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20498","marks":["code"],"text":"import"},{"id":"spn-20499","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20500","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_register"},{"id":"spn-20501","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20502","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_discover"},{"id":"spn-20503","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20504","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_generate"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19741","spans":[{"id":"spn-20505","marks":["code"],"text":"interact"}]},{"id":"blk-19742","spans":[{"id":"spn-20506","marks":["code"],"text":"run"},{"id":"spn-20507","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20508","marks":["code"],"text":"run_sequence"},{"id":"spn-20509","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20510","marks":["code"],"text":"run_matrix"},{"id":"spn-20511","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20512","marks":["code"],"text":"status"},{"id":"spn-20513","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20514","marks":["code"],"text":"transcript"},{"id":"spn-20515","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20516","marks":["code"],"text":"cancel"},{"id":"spn-20517","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20518","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_evaluate"},{"id":"spn-20519","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20520","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_compare"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19743","spans":[{"id":"spn-20521","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"}]},{"id":"blk-19744","spans":[{"id":"spn-20522","marks":["code"],"text":"judge_transcript"},{"id":"spn-20523","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20524","marks":["code"],"text":"judge_dimension"},{"id":"spn-20525","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20526","marks":["code"],"text":"meta_judge"},{"id":"spn-20527","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20528","marks":["code"],"text":"meta_judge_batch"},{"id":"spn-20529","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20530","marks":["code"],"text":"override"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19745","spans":[{"id":"spn-20531","marks":["code"],"text":"reflect"}]},{"id":"blk-19746","spans":[{"id":"spn-20532","marks":["code"],"text":"analyze_gaps"},{"id":"spn-20533","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20534","marks":["code"],"text":"evolve"},{"id":"spn-20535","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20536","marks":["code"],"text":"advance_cycle"},{"id":"spn-20537","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20538","marks":["code"],"text":"calibrate_irt"},{"id":"spn-20539","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20540","marks":["code"],"text":"cycle_history"},{"id":"spn-20541","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20542","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_recommend"},{"id":"spn-20543","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20544","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_infer_profile"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19747","spans":[{"id":"spn-20545","marks":["code"],"text":"diagnose"}]},{"id":"blk-19748","spans":[{"id":"spn-20546","marks":["code"],"text":"report"},{"id":"spn-20547","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20548","marks":["code"],"text":"failure_patterns"},{"id":"spn-20549","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20550","marks":["code"],"text":"retest"},{"id":"spn-20551","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20552","marks":["code"],"text":"verify"},{"id":"spn-20553","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20554","marks":["code"],"text":"regressions"},{"id":"spn-20555","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20556","marks":["code"],"text":"suggest_fixes"},{"id":"spn-20557","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20558","marks":["code"],"text":"leaderboard"},{"id":"spn-20559","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20560","marks":["code"],"text":"leaderboard_history"},{"id":"spn-20561","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20562","marks":["code"],"text":"compare_systems"},{"id":"spn-20563","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20564","marks":["code"],"text":"dimension_leaders"},{"id":"spn-20565","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20566","marks":["code"],"text":"fit_recommendation"},{"id":"spn-20567","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20568","marks":["code"],"text":"compare_fit"},{"id":"spn-20569","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20570","marks":["code"],"text":"task_profiles"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19749","spans":[{"id":"spn-20571","marks":["code"],"text":"config"}]},{"id":"blk-19750","spans":[{"id":"spn-20572","marks":["code"],"text":"set_weights"},{"id":"spn-20573","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20574","marks":["code"],"text":"register_system"},{"id":"spn-20575","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20576","marks":["code"],"text":"list_systems"},{"id":"spn-20577","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20578","marks":["code"],"text":"get_config"},{"id":"spn-20579","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20580","marks":["code"],"text":"create_profile"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-19751","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20581","text":"All 47 actions are already implemented in Elixir under "},{"id":"spn-20582","marks":["code"],"text":"PRISM/lib/prism/mcp/machines/"},{"id":"spn-20583","text":". The npm wrapper does not add or remove actions; it only exposes them over the MCP SDK's stdio transport."}]},{"id":"blk-19752","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20584","text":"MCP Resources"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-19754","spans":[{"id":"spn-20585","text":"URI"}]},{"id":"blk-19755","spans":[{"id":"spn-20586","text":"Returns"}]}],"id":"blk-19753","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-19756","spans":[{"id":"spn-20587","marks":["code"],"text":"prism://runtime/health"}]},{"id":"blk-19757","spans":[{"id":"spn-20588","text":"Engine health, pending run count, queue depth."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19758","spans":[{"id":"spn-20589","marks":["code"],"text":"prism://systems/registered"}]},{"id":"blk-19759","spans":[{"id":"spn-20590","text":"Registered BYOR systems."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19760","spans":[{"id":"spn-20591","marks":["code"],"text":"prism://runs/recent"}]},{"id":"blk-19761","spans":[{"id":"spn-20592","text":"Recent benchmark runs."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19762","spans":[{"id":"spn-20593","marks":["code"],"text":"prism://leaderboard/{profile}"}]},{"id":"blk-19763","spans":[{"id":"spn-20594","text":"Leaderboard for a given task profile."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19764","spans":[{"id":"spn-20595","marks":["code"],"text":"prism://scenarios/{id}"}]},{"id":"blk-19765","spans":[{"id":"spn-20596","text":"Scenario definition."}]}],[{"id":"blk-19766","spans":[{"id":"spn-20597","marks":["code"],"text":"prism://transcripts/{run_id}"}]},{"id":"blk-19767","spans":[{"id":"spn-20598","text":"Full transcript for a run."}]}]]},{"id":"blk-19768","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20599","text":"Project Layout"}]},{"id":"blk-19769","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"PRISM/\n├── package.json                    # \"name\": \"os-prism\"\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── bin/\n│   └── os-prism.js\n├── src/\n│   ├── server.ts                   # MCP wiring\n│   ├── db.ts                       # projection DB\n│   ├── engine.ts                   # spawn + JSON-RPC over stdio\n│   ├── tools/\n│   │   ├── compose.ts\n│   │   ├── interact.ts\n│   │   ├── observe.ts\n│   │   ├── reflect.ts\n│   │   ├── diagnose.ts\n│   │   └── config.ts\n│   ├── resources/ …\n│   └── cli.ts\n├── scripts/\n│   └── postinstall.js              # fetch vendor/prism_engine\n└── lib/                            # existing Elixir PRISM app (escript source)"},{"id":"blk-19770","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20600","text":"Build and Publish"}]},{"id":"blk-19771","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"cd PRISM\n# 1. Build the Elixir escript engine for each target platform\nMIX_ENV=prod mix escript.build          # writes to ./prism_engine\n# 2. Upload to GitHub Releases under tag os-prism-v0.1.0 (CI)\n# 3. Build and publish the TS wrapper\nnpm install\nnpm run build\nnpm publish --access public"},{"id":"blk-19772","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20601","text":"Why os-prism ships third"}]},{"id":"blk-19773","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20602","text":"1. Optionally reads a system-under-test's "},{"id":"spn-20603","marks":["code"],"text":"*.ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-20604","text":" spec graph (via the [&] reference CLI / SDKs) to understand what it is composed of. 2. Depends on "},{"id":"spn-20605","marks":["code"],"text":"os-pulse"},{"id":"spn-20606","text":" to read the system-under-test's PULSE manifest and discover the "},{"id":"spn-20607","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-20608","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-20609","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-20610","text":" boundaries. 3. Requires the graphonomous-style postinstall escript pattern, which is the most complex install path of the three packages."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieranggqxkrouayfgkppc6vt6sg54exo6gxp72neyaet3nq52tyeeq5a","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}